{"speciesId":325,"names":{"fr":"Spoink","es":"Spoink","en":"Spoink","ja":"バネブー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SPOINK bounces around on its tail. The shock of its bouncing makes its heart pump. As a result, this POKéMON cannot afford to stop bouncing - if it stops, its heart will stop."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SPOINK keeps a pearl on top of its head. The pearl functions to amplify this POKéMON’s psychokinetic powers. It is therefore on a constant search for a bigger pearl."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A POKéMON that manipulates psychic power at will. It doesn’t stop bouncing even when it is asleep. It loves eating mushrooms that grow underground."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It apparently dies if it stops bouncing about. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It apparently dies if it stops bouncing about. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il utilise sa queue comme un ressort et bondit partout. Chaque nouveau choc fait battre son cœur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il utilise sa queue comme un ressort et bondit partout. Chaque nouveau choc fait battre son cœur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Using its tail like a spring, it keeps its heart beating by bouncing constantly. If it stops, it dies."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Using its tail like a spring, it keeps its heart beating by bouncing constantly. If it stops, it dies."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il utilise sa queue comme un ressort et bondit partout. Chaque nouveau choc fait battre son cœur."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Bota continuamente usando su cola como muelle. Salta para mantener el latido de su corazón."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"尻尾を バネのかわりに いつも 飛び跳ねている。跳ねる 振動で 心臓を 鼓動 させているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il rebondit sur sa queue pour faire battre son cœur. La perle sur sa tête vient d’un Coquiperl."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Bota usando su cola para mantener el latido de su corazón. Lleva una perla de Clamperl en la cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from Clamperl on its head."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"尻尾で 飛び跳ねて 心臓を 動かしている。パールルの 作った 真珠を 頭に 乗せている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Spoink rebondit sur sa queue. Le choc du rebond fait battre son cœur. Du coup, ce Pokémon ne peut pas s’arrêter de rebondir, sinon, son cœur s’arrête."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Spoink se pasa todo el día saltando sobre la cola. Cada salto hace que le lata el corazón. Por eso, no puede permitirse dejar de saltar. Si lo hiciera, se le pararía."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Spoink bounces around on its tail. The shock of its bouncing makes its heart pump. As a result, this Pokémon cannot afford to stop bouncing—if it stops, its heart will stop."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"シッポで びょんびょん 飛び跳ねる ポケモン。 飛び跳ねる 振動で 心臓を 動かして いるので 飛び跳ねる ことは 止められないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Spoink garde une perle sur sa tête. Elle lui sert à amplifier ses pouvoirs télékinétiques. Il est constamment en quête d’une perle plus grosse."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Spoink lleva una perla en la cabeza, que sirve para amplificar los poderes psicoquinéticos que tiene. Por eso, está continuamente buscando una perla mayor."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Spoink keeps a pearl on top of its head. The pearl functions to amplify this Pokémon’s psychokinetic powers. It is therefore on a constant search for a bigger pearl."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"頭に 乗せた 真珠が バネブーの サイコパワーを 高める 働きをする。 大きな 真珠を いつも 探している。"}],"varieties":[{"id":325,"moves":[{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[23,"level-up",10],[25,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[5,"level-up",16],[6,"level-up",16],[7,"level-up",16],[8,"level-up",14],[9,"level-up",14],[10,"level-up",14],[11,"level-up",14],[12,"level-up",16],[13,"level-up",16],[14,"level-up",14],[15,"level-up",14],[16,"level-up",14],[17,"level-up",14],[18,"level-up",14],[23,"level-up",14],[25,"level-up",14],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-w